[b]Architecture, cutaway and native rendering[/b]

The upper shell is inspected intact as well as through the player cutaway. Classic and experimental Enhanced rendering both have native evidence; prepared views contain no live actors or server simulation.

[i]Prepared native render — An intact prepared inspection of the original pump assembly.[/i]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/83e1b40d52b34bcbe50b5d9662f5a61a37bb2282/images/tower-map/21-machinery-detail.png[/img]

[i]Prepared native render — The upper shell intact, shown separately from the player cutaway view.[/i]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/83e1b40d52b34bcbe50b5d9662f5a61a37bb2282/images/tower-map/22-intact-vault.png[/img]

[i]Prepared native render — Whole-floor study through the Classic native renderer.[/i]
