[i]Live native gameplay — Final handoff capture: actual native Enhanced client after a waterworks reconnect.[/i]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/83e1b40d52b34bcbe50b5d9662f5a61a37bb2282/images/tower-map/24-live-final-waterworks.png[/img]

The latest live pass also repairs missing paving after regional reloads and gives the minimap the authored room geography. Frame pacing still needs work, and the art is a review candidate rather than a finished or approved floor. Feedback on scale, room identity and the connections between spaces is welcome.

[i]AI concept illustration, prepared native renders and live gameplay are labeled separately. Original custom scenery is shown alongside authentic game assets where present; RuneScape / OSRS belongs to Jagex. Unofficial project, unaffiliated with Jagex.[/i]
